  body: sled
  top: snowcannon
  decal: zigzag
  gadget: snowball
  meetLines:
  - surprised|Whoa, careful! You nearly scratched my goggles. Do you know who I am?
  - smug|Sven Snowdrift. Ski instructor, snow legend, and the best hair on the mountain.
  - laugh|This is my snowball cannon. Anyone in front of me gets a face full of snow!
  - 'wink|Beat me on Glacier Pass and the cannon is yours. Spoiler: you won''t.'
  cardLine: Glacier Pass is my mountain. Try not to cry, rookie!
  startLines:
  - smug|Watch and learn, rookie!
  - wink|Stay in front of me... if you dare!
  - laugh|Hope you like snowballs!
  winLines:
  - laugh|Ha! Did you see my hair? Not one strand moved!
  - 'wink|Lesson one: never race Sven!'
  - smug|Better luck next winter!
  loseLines:
  - angry|My goggles fogged up. Totally unfair!
  - surprised|Wait... you beat ME?
  - thinking|Hmm. Must have been the wax on my skis.
